*  seam_det_rightmost_red — a DETERMINISTIC element sits to the RIGHT of the generator. The blob beta dead-ended at PAT$N_omega until s124's leftward seam walk.
        Command = 'a'
        Parse   = ARBNO(*Command) LEN(0)
        Src     = 'aaa'
        Src POS(0) *Parse RPOS(0)                             :S(OK)F(NO)
OK      OUTPUT = 'MATCH'                                      :(END)
NO      OUTPUT = 'NOMATCH'
END
